{"tool_name":"pystablemotifs","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"pystablemotifs","home":"https://github.com/jcrozum/pystablemotifs/","license":"MIT","summary":"Python library for attractor identification and control in Boolean networks.","addition_date":"2022-05-17T18:21:42.584807Z","last_update_date":"2022-05-17T18:21:42.587703Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:pystablemotifs","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"jcr52@psu.edu","name":"Jordan C Rozum","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4356-9809","typeEntity":"Person"},{"email":"orrza1@psu.edu","name":"R\u00e9ka Albert","typeEntity":"Person"},{"name":"D\u00e1vid Deritei"},{"name":"Jorge G\u00f3mez Tejeda Za\u00f1udo"},{"name":"Kyu Hyong Park"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Network analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3927"}]}],"name":"pystablemotifs","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"Jennifer","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/BIOINFORMATICS/BTAB825","metadata":{"abstract":"\u00a9 2021 The Author(s) 2021. Published by Oxford University Press. All rights reserved.Summary: pystablemotifs is a Python 3 library for analyzing Boolean networks. Its non-heuristic and exhaustive attractor identification algorithm was previously presented in Rozum et al. (2021). Here, we illustrate its performance improvements over similar methods and discuss how it uses outputs of the attractor identification process to drive a system to one of its attractors from any initial state. We implement six attractor control algorithms, five of which are new in this work. By design, these algorithms can return different control strategies, allowing for synergistic use. We also give a brief overview of the other tools implemented in pystablemotifs.","authors":[{"name":"Albert R."},{"name":"Deritei D."},{"name":"Park K.H."},{"name":"Rozum J.C."},{"name":"Zanudo J.G.T."}],"date":"2022-03-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Bioinformatics","title":"Pystablemotifs: Python library for attractor identification and control in Boolean networks"},"pmid":"34875008"}],"topic":[{"term":"Sequence sites, features and motifs","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0160"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"pystablemotifs","home":"https://bio.tools/pystablemotifs","license":"MIT","summary":"Python library for attractor identification and control in Boolean networks.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:pystablemotifs/cmd/github.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"binaries":{"freeness":null,"registration":null},"packages":null,"source_packages":false,"sourcecode":{"free":null,"interpreted":true,"license":null,"public":true,"readme":false,"repository":{"anonymous":null,"online":null}}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"license":{"open_source":true,"osi":true},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":16,"citations":[{"count":2,"year":"2022"},{"count":3,"year":"2023"},{"count":3,"year":"2024"},{"count":4,"year":"2025"},{"count":4,"year":"2026"}],"doi":"10.1093/bioinformatics/btab825","pmid":"34875008","ref_count":0,"refs":[],"title":"pystablemotifs: Python library for attractor identification and control in Boolean networks.","year":2022}]}],"readme":false,"summary":{"description":true},"website":{"bioschemas":true,"copyright":false,"https":true,"license":false,"operational":200,"ssl":true,"ssl_err":null}},"support":{"issue_tracking":{"public_tracker":null,"resolve_time":null}}},{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/pystablemotifs","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":null,"@type":"metrics","distribution":{"binaries":{"freeness":null,"registration":null},"packages":null,"source_packages":false,"sourcecode":{"free":null,"interpreted":